{
  "slug": "0x",
  "name": "0x",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Guide developers through swapping ERC-20 tokens using the 0x API. Covers standard swaps via AllowanceHolder and Permit2 as well as gasless swaps across 20+ EVM chains — walking through price quotes, approvals, EIP-712 signing, and transaction submission. Also helps integrate 0x swaps directly into your app with code samples.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `0x-agentic-gateway`, `0x-api` (Step-by-step guide for executing token swaps using the 0x API (Swap API v2 and Gasless API v2))\n- **MCP servers** (1): `0x-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install 0x@claude-community` from `0xProject/0x-ai`.",
